"权别其族为丁氏，禁锢终身","attribution":"裴注·江表传","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":170,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2e477cf123d96200cb3b","start":62,"end":74,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-e779c3e3fb805e4b2d4e","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-ed5ad5f26ebf8a9ed071","layer":"pei","quote":"时匡为定武中郎将，（遣）〔违〕范令放火，烧损茅芒。以乏军用，范即启送匡还吴","attribution":"裴注·江表传","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":170,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2e477cf123d96200cb3b","start":24,"end":61,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q2-d35eacf1577190447494","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-ed5ad5f26ebf8a9ed071","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之按：本传曰：“匡未试用，卒，时年二十余。”而《江表传》云吕范在洞口，匡为定武中郎将。既为定武，非为未试用。且孙坚以初平二年卒，洞口之役在黄初三年，坚卒至此合三十一年；匡时若尚在，本传不得云卒时年二十余也。此盖权别生弟朗，《江表传》误以为匡也。朗之名位，见《三朝录》及虞喜《志林》也。","attribution":"裴松之按","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":170,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2e477cf123d96200cb3b","start":76,"end":220,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
